  "notes": "{漬|つ}け{込|こ}む emphasizes thorough soaking for extended periods.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦タレ→タレ：10500_tare⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{漬|つ}け{込|こ}む: to marinate in sauce\n- ⟦{一晩|ひとばん}→一晩：08887_hitoban⟧{漬|つ}け{込|こ}む: to marinate overnight\n- ⟦{調味料|ちょうみりょう}→調味料：04941_choumiryou⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{漬|つ}け{込|こ}む: to soak in seasonings\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{漬|つ}ける→漬ける：09861_tsukeru⟧: to soak, to pickle (general)\n- マリネ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to marinate (loanword)\n- ⟦{塩漬|しおづ}け→塩漬け：09008_shiozuke⟧: salting, pickling in salt\n\nUSAGE:\nDifferent from ⟦{付|つ}け{込|こ}む→付け込む：10372_tsukekomu⟧ which means \"to take advantage of.\"",
